| Trace | 固定96 (best) | RL 96 | RL 256 | GDSF |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **1063** | **0.323** | 0.371 | 0.367 | **0.277** |
| **wiki** | **0.582** | 0.594 | 0.593 | 0.606 |
